ion of long-term atmospheric drought trends into hydrological drought.</b></figcaption><div class="c-article-section__figure-content"><div class="c-article-section__figure-item"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="//media.springernature.com/m312/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1038%2Fs44221-026-00724-8/MediaObjects/44221_2026_724_Fig3_HTML.png?as=webp"><img src="//media.springernature.com/m312/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1038%2Fs44221-026-00724-8/MediaObjects/44221_2026_724_Fig3_HTML.png" alt="" loading="lazy" width="312" height="199"></picture></div></div></figure></div>
