                    <div class="u-mt-32">
                        <section data-title="Data availability"><div class="c-article-section" id="data-availability-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="data-availability">Data availability</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="data-availability-content">
            
            <p>Streamflow records were compiled from 29 global and regional hydrometric networks and databases as described in the Methods. Supplementary Table <a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="supplementary material anchor" href="/articles/s44221-026-00724-8#MOESM1">2</a> provides the complete list of contributing agencies and datasets, together with the corresponding data-access links used to obtain the original streamflow records. Owing to data-use restrictions imposed by several contributing agencies and data providers, we are unable to redistribute the original streamflow observations publicly. Instead, we provide metadata for all catchments included in the analysis, including catchment identifiers, geographic locations and relevant catchment attributes via Zenodo at <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22065571">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22065571</a> (ref. <sup><a data-track="click" data-track-action="reference anchor" data-track-label="link" data-test="citation-ref" aria-label="Reference 90" title="Guo, Y. et al. Metadata and source data for research entitled global hydrological drought diverges from atmospheric drying. Zenodo &#xA;                https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22065571&#xA;                &#xA;               (2026)." href="/articles/s44221-026-00724-8#ref-CR90" id="ref-link-section-d15889064e1773">90</a></sup>). ISIMIP3a simulation outputs are publicly available at <a href="https://data.isimip.org/search/">https://data.isimip.org/search/</a>. Historical gridded climate datasets (CHIRPS v3, MSWEP v2, GLEAM4 and hPET) are available from their respective repositories as described in the Methods. Source data are provided with this paper. These data are also available via Zenodo at <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22065571">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22065571</a> (ref. <sup><a data-track="click" data-track-action="reference anchor" data-track-label="link" data-test="citation-ref" aria-label="Reference 90" title="Guo, Y. et al. Metadata and source data for research entitled global hydrological drought diverges from atmospheric drying. Zenodo &#xA;                https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22065571&#xA;                &#xA;               (2026)." href="/articles/s44221-026-00724-8#ref-CR90" id="ref-link-section-d15889064e1792">90</a></sup>).</p>
          </div></div></section><section data-title="Code availability"><div class="c-article-section" id="code-availability-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="code-availability">Code availability</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="code-availability-content">
            
            <p>SPEI and SSI were computed in Python using the lmoments3 and scipy.stats packages for distribution fitting, with parallel processing implemented via Dask.</p>
          </div></div></section><div id="MagazineFulltextArticleBodySuffix"><section aria-labelledby="Bib1" data-title="References"><div class="c-article-section" id="Bib1-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="Bib1">References</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="Bib1-content"><div data-container-section="references"><ol class="c-article-references" data-track-component="outbound reference" data-track-context="references section"><li class="c-article-references__item js-c-reading-companion-references-item" data-counter="1."><p class="c-article-references__text" id="ref-CR1">Mishra, A. K. &amp; Singh, V. P. A review of drought concepts. <i>J. Hydrol.</i> <b>391</b>, 202–216 (2010).</p><p class="c-article-references__links u-hide-print"><a data-track="click_references" rel="nofollow noopener" data-track-label="10.1016/j.jhydrol.2010.07.012" data-track-item_id="10.1016/j.jhydrol.2010.07.012" data-track-value="article reference" data-track-action="article reference" href="https://doi.org/10.1016%2Fj.jhydrol.2010.07.012" aria-label="Article reference 1" data-doi="10.1016/j.jhydrol.2010.07.012">Article</a> 
